{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1745762,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Craft N Code (Karnataka)","festival_id":496201,"organization_id":11832,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-06T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2027-02-06T16:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"hackathons","public_url":"hackathons\/craft-n-code-karnataka-international-institute-of-information-technology-iiit-bhubaneswar-1745762","region":"online","details":"<p><strong>Craft N Code &ndash; Karnataka State Qualifier<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>This State Round is exclusively for students studying in colleges across Karnataka. Please register only if your institution is located in Karnataka.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Get ready to showcase your innovation, creativity, and coding skills at the Craft N Code Karnataka State Qualifier, organized by RVCE &amp; RVITM. This qualifier provides an opportunity for Karnataka's talented student innovators to showcase their skills and compete for a chance to advance to the Craft N Code National Hackathon, hosted by IIIT Bhubaneswar.<\/p>\n<p>The Karnataka State Qualifier will follow a structured evaluation process where teams will get the opportunity to understand the challenge, brainstorm innovative ideas, develop technology-driven solutions, and present their projects. Participants will be evaluated on their problem-solving approach, innovation, technical implementation, creativity, presentation, and overall impact of their solutions.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Important Dates:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Registration Opens: 28 August 2026<\/li>\n<li>Online 48hrs Hackathon: 17-18 October 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Craft N Code is more than just a coding competition, it is a platform for solving real-world problems through technology, collaboration, creativity, and innovation. Participants will get the opportunity to transform their ideas into practical solutions while working alongside talented students and developers from across Karnataka.<\/p>\n<p><strong>What's in it for you?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>An opportunity to compete at the Craft N Code State Qualifier<\/li>\n<li>A chance to advance toward the Craft N Code National Hackathon at IIIT Bhubaneswar<\/li>\n<li>Showcase your creativity and technical expertise<\/li>\n<li>Collaborate with talented students and innovators<\/li>\n<li>Gain experience solving real-world problem statements<\/li>\n<li>Earn certificates and recognition<\/li>\n<li>Strengthen your resume and technical portfolio<\/li>\n<li>Network with fellow developers and technology enthusiasts<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>If you're ready to challenge yourself, build innovative solutions, and showcase your technical skills, this is your opportunity to step forward.<\/p>\n<p>Gather your team, register from 28 August 2026, and get ready to Craft N Code!<\/p>\n<p>Let's innovate. Let's build. Let's Craft N Code.<\/p>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":null,"registration_clicks":0,"user_id":22795458,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-08-28T21:22:18+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-07T21:54:58+05:30","communication_sent":1,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"online_coding_challenge","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"uhsP4Zg","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":2,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":30,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-08-28 21:22:18","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":false,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","